Z||000000||FieroBUZZ||10-17-2001||05:22 PM||||Working on an under the front lower airdam. If I were to use a portion of the bumper cover, can it be heated a bit and molded to a wood plug?  Will it form? Does it have a 'memory' to retain the new shape? or will it bounce back to the old.  The change will not be too drastic.<P>Thanks, Gary||||reg||5
